            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu Trivia uygulaması, doğru yanıtı gönderirsek <code>Correct!</code>, yanlış yanıtı seçersek <code>Not quite!</code> görüntüler.</p><p>Programlarımızda bunun gibi kararlar almak için koşullara dayanan <code>if</code> ifadelerine ihtiyacımız var.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    font-size: 20px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    height: 400px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   button {&#xA;    width: 200px;&#xA;    height: 30px;&#xA;    font-size: 20px;&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    display: block;&#xA;    background-color: black;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    outline: none;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   .radioDiv {&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    width: auto;&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;    display: table;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   .questionDiv {&#xA;    border: 1px solid #f0f5fd;&#xA;    border-radius: 20px;&#xA;    padding-top: 10px;&#xA;    padding-bottom: 20px;&#xA;    padding-left: 10px;&#xA;    padding-right: 10px;&#xA;    width: 300px;&#xA;    height: 200px;&#xA;    background-color: #d9e8fb;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body id=&quot;main&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Trivia Time&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&quot;questionDiv&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;h3&gt;Which painter was born in Spain?&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div class=&quot;radioDiv&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input type=&quot;radio&quot; name=&quot;painter&quot; value=&quot;picasso&quot;&gt; Picasso&lt;br&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input type=&quot;radio&quot; name=&quot;painter&quot; value=&quot;matisse&quot;&gt;&#xA;    Matisse&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;   &lt;button onClick=&quot;check()&quot;&gt;Submit&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function check() {&#xA;    let feedback = document.getElementById(&quot;feedback&quot;);&#xA;    let radios = document.getElementsByName('painter');&#xA;    let body = document.getElementById(&quot;main&quot;);&#xA;    if (feedback !== null) {&#xA;     body.removeChild(feedback);&#xA;    }&#xA;    for (let i = 0, length = radios.length; i &lt; length; i++) {&#xA;     let paragraph = document.createElement(&quot;p&quot;);&#xA;     paragraph.id = &quot;feedback&quot;;&#xA;     console.log(&quot;checking&quot;);&#xA;     if (radios[i].checked) {&#xA;      console.log(&quot;found&quot;);&#xA;      if (radios[i].value === &quot;picasso&quot;) {&#xA;       paragraph.innerHTML = &quot;Correct!&quot;;&#xA;       paragraph.style.color = &quot;#62d76b&quot;;&#xA;      } else {&#xA;       paragraph.innerHTML = &quot;Not quite!&quot;;&#xA;       paragraph.style.color = &quot;#d7465f&quot;;&#xA;      }&#xA;      body.appendChild(paragraph);&#xA;      break;&#xA;     }&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
